{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "JOB",
  "chapter": 4,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then Eliphaz the Temanite answered and said,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " we essay to commune with thee, wilt thou be grieved? but who can refrain from speaking?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, thou hast instructed many, and thou hast strengthened the weak hands.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thy words have upheld him that was falling, and thou hast strengthened the feeble knees.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But now it hath come upon thee, and thou faintest; it toucheth thee, and thou art troubled.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "this",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy fear, thy confidence, thy hope, and the uprightness of thy ways?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Remember, I pray thee, who ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "ever",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " perished, being innocent? or where were the righteous cut off;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Even as I have seen, they that plow iniquity, and sow wickedness, reap the same.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "By the blast of God they perish, and by the breath of his nostrils are they consumed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The roaring of the lion, and the voice of the fierce lion, and the teeth of the young lions, are broken.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The old lion perisheth for lack of prey, and the stout lion's whelps are scattered abroad.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now a thing was secretly brought to me, and my ear received a small sound of it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In thoughts from the visions of the night, when deep sleep falleth on men.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Fear came upon me, and trembling, which made all my bones to shake.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then a spirit passed before my face; the hair of my flesh stood up:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It stood still, but I could not discern its form: an image ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " before my eyes, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " silence, and I heard a voice, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "saying",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Shall mortal man be more just than God? shall a man be more pure than his maker?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, he put no trust in his servants; and his angels he charged with folly:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "How much less ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " them that dwell in houses of clay, whose foundation ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the dust, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "who",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " are crushed before the moth?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They are destroyed from morning to evening: they perish for ever without any regarding ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.4.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.4.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Doth not their excellence ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "which is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in them depart? they die, even without wisdom.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
